+- No reachable priority rule bypasses function-body execution.
+
+The only concrete false-behavior witness found on the formal integer domain is
+the unmodeled CPython overflow above. I do not label unreachable baseline rules
+unsound without a witness connecting them to an entry state of this theorem.

